BT /F1 16 Tf 45 770 Td (Notifications, audit and timing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 45 740 Td (The deadline scheduler checks open tasks due within the next 24 hours \(including overdue) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 45 726 Td (tasks\) and creates a notification for each assignee, suppressing repeats for 24 hours. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 45 712 Td (runs at startup and then hourly by default. The current Kanban interface polls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 45 698 Td (notifications and workspace audit activity every 10 seconds; users can mark their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 45 684 Td (notifications read. The scheduler is periodic, so this is not an exact deadline-time push.) Tj ET
